<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Empaq to reactivate ADR program.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Empaq to reactivate ADR program.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1996-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Empaques Ponderosa SA (Empaq) on Tuesday said it reached an agreement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) to reactivate its American Depository Receipts (ADRs).</p>
<p>Each ADR will equal 25 Mexican shares, the cardboard maker said in a news release.</p>
</text>
